									<p><strong>Ans: </strong> Yes, a document may be rejected by the Mission in the absence of meeting pre-attestation criteria. We suggest to ensure that the submitted document is attested by relevant authorities to avoid any inconvenience. Our teams can provide guidance if there are any discrepancies.</p>
